---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Sermons
description: "Watch Faith Baptist Church of Raymore live, or browse past services on our YouTube channel."
---

<div class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="page-head__eyebrow">Sermons</p>
    <h1>Watch live, or catch up any time</h1>
    <p class="page-head__lede">Our services are streamed live on YouTube and stay available on our channel afterwards.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap prose">
  <h2>Live stream</h2>

  <p>Sunday morning worship, Sunday evening, and our Wednesday evening Bible study are streamed as they happen. If a service is not currently live, the link below will show you the most recent one.</p>

  <p><a class="btn btn--outline" href="{{ church.social.youtubeLive }}">Watch the live stream</a></p>

  <h2>Past services</h2>

  <p>Our YouTube channel holds recordings of previous services &mdash; Sunday School, Sunday morning and evening worship, Wednesday evening Bible study, and special services such as our revival and missions conference meetings.</p>

  <p><a class="btn btn--outline" href="{{ church.social.youtube }}">Browse our YouTube channel</a></p>

  <h2>When we meet</h2>

  <div class="full-width">
    <div class="times__grid">
      {%- for service in church.services %}
      <div class="time-card">
        <p class="time-card__day">{{ service.day }}</p>
        <span class="time-card__time">{{ service.time }}</span>
        <p class="time-card__name">{{ service.name }}</p>
        {%- if service.note %}<span class="time-card__note">For {{ service.note }}</span>{% endif %}
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="visit-cta">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>We would love to meet you</h2>
    <p>{{ church.address.street }} &middot; {{ church.address.city }}, {{ church.address.stateAbbr }}</p>
    <p class="visit-cta__actions">
      <a class="btn btn--light" href="/visit/">Plan your visit</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{{ church.phoneHref }}">{{ church.phone }}</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
